Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:51:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/27] flight: a Flight scan makes no distribution claim

visitPhysicalJDBCScan reported a gathered distribution, so the optimizer planned
one-phase aggregates and no exchange above a scan that runs one fragment
instance per endpoint. Report no distribution for Flight tables so exchanges
and two-phase aggregates are planned.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
