 .../FlightScanOutputPropertyTest.java         | 61 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 fe/fe-core/src/test/java/com/starrocks/sql/optimizer/FlightScanOutputPropertyTest.java

