From 887db5221171c8e1361cda2581f6a4248486b0d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Code <vadim.surpin@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:03:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/27] flight: give the join key fetch its own time budget

Planning waited on the Flight server for the distinct join keys, so a busy or
cold server pushed the logical phase past new_planner_optimize_timeout and the
whole query failed. The fetch now stops after flight.join_key_reduction.timeout_ms
(default 1000) and the plan stays unreduced.

