The predicate converter now renders column-to-column comparisons, LIKE/NOT LIKE,
substring(col, c, c) and year/month/day(col) next to the existing column versus
constant forms, and a column that only a pushed predicate reads is no longer
fetched. FlightMetadata reports row count and column statistics (bounds, nulls,
sizes, distinct counts) from the server, and the statistics calculator uses them
for Flight scans instead of the one-row default.

